            "text": "This section provides information about $(thing)armor trims$() in $(item)Simply Journey$(). $(br2)By default, if you wear three armors with the same trim, it will give you a $(bold)level 1$() effect, while if you wear all four parts of the armor with the same trim, the effect will be $(bold)level 2$(). $(br2)Now, all minerals are valid and $(item)resin$() has also been added, which will give night vision."
